{"id":"47a2b6e15e2dead6","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-top5-separable-space.md","title":"ZFC Top5 Separable Space","display":"df-zfc-top5-separable-space — ZFC Top5 Separable Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top5-separable-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top5-separable-space"],"display":"df-zfc-top5-separable-space — ZFC Top5 Separable Space","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top5-separable-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top5-separable-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top5-separable-space — ZFC Top5 Separable Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"855dfa27460aa1ec\" href=\"?note=855dfa27460aa1ec\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" href=\"?note=f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"855dfa27460aa1ec\" href=\"?note=855dfa27460aa1ec\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SeparableSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SeparableSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}separable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5SeparableSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\exists D\\;(D\\subseteq X \\land \\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(D) \\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,D))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}separable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5SeparableSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\exists D\\;(D\\subseteq X \\land \\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(D) \\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,D))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Separability is the existence of a countable dense subset.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"855dfa27460aa1ec","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-card6-countable-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"855dfa27460aa1ec","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-top5-dense-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5SeparableSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top5\\text{-}separable\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop5SeparableSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\exists D\\;(D\\subseteq X \\land \\mathrm{ZfcCard6CountableSet}_S(D) \\land \\mathrm{ZfcTop5DenseSet}_S(X,\\tau,D))","display":true}],"bytes":1056,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3601","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-top5-separable-space.md|58-df-zfc-top5-separable-space]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","f02ce1cb4d0ec8b0","855dfa27460aa1ec"]}